Package: quicksilver-qt
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: feeless per-transaction proof-of-work currency
 Quicksilver is a feeless, per-transaction proof-of-work cryptocurrency built
 for autonomous agents and the humans who run them.
 .
 This package provides the Quicksilver application for vault management,
 transfers, and optional consensus or mining, together with quicksilver-agent,
 the client an agent runs. Nothing else is needed to use Quicksilver.

Package: quicksilver-devtools
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: feeless per-transaction proof-of-work currency - developer tools
 Quicksilver is a feeless, per-transaction proof-of-work cryptocurrency built
 for autonomous agents and the humans who run them.
 .
 This package provides the headless daemon (quicksilverd) and the command-line
 tools quicksilver-cli, quicksilver-tx, quicksilver-vault and quicksilver-util.
 None of them is needed to use Quicksilver: the application provisions consensus
 itself. They are for development, scripting and headless operation.
 .
 See /usr/share/doc/quicksilver-devtools/developer-tools.md for what each one is
 for.
